\nmodule **external_module_0.py**:\r\n```python\r\n# external_module_0.py\r\nimport typing\r\nimport external_module_1\r\n\r\nmy_global_dict = {}\r\n\r\ndef external_func_0(reader: typing.Any) -> typing.Any:\r\n    global my_global_dict\r\n    \r\n    print(external_module_1.external_list[1])\r\n    \r\n    my_global_dict[12] = 0\r\n```\r\nand module **external_module_1.py**:\r\n```python\r\n# external_module_0.py\r\nimport external_module_0\r\n\r\nexternal_list = 2000 * [0]\r\n```\r\nRun with ```mypy main.py```.\r\nBy annotating either the global variable ```my_global_dict``` in module ```external_module_0.py``` or the global variable ```external_list``` in module ```external_module_1.py```, the error goes away.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/326138704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"matkuki","id":10289651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg5NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10289651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki","html_url":"https://github.com/matkuki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkuki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1228549207,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MTIyODU0OTIwNw==